The Setup block still told people to clone bounded.tools.git, which is why
checkouts of this repo end up in a directory named bounded.tools/ while a
separate, unrelated bounded-systems/bounded.tools repo (the prx receiver
Worker at hooks.bounded.tools) exists. Add a Naming section that states
which repo is which and why, cites the other by URL, gives the local-dir
fix (mv bounded.tools site; origin is the source of truth), and records
the rename proposal without executing it. Fix the clone URL and drop the
submodule steps the clone block still carried (brand has been an npm
dependency since #137).

Fixes #32

